## 6. 状态枚举：12 个车辆运行状态

文件：`src/services/unmannedVehicleNew/types.ts`

```ts
export enum VehicleStatus {
  DELIVERYING = 'DELIVERYING', // 派送中
  PICKING = 'PICKING',         // 揽收中
  VACANT = 'VACANT',           // 空闲中
  MOVING = 'MOVING',           // 移车中
  CHARGING = 'CHARGING',       // 充电中
  DISABLED = 'DISABLED',       // 不可用
  LOADING = 'LOADING',         // 装货中
  RETURN = 'RETURN',           // 返程中
  SHUTDOWN = 'SHUTDOWN',       // 关机
  IN_STARTUP = 'IN_STARTUP',   // 开机中
  IN_SHUTDOWN = 'IN_SHUTDOWN', // 关机中
  CORRECT = 'CORRECT',         // 串站中 / 纠偏中
}
```

简历里如果说“7/12 激活状态触发轮询”，对应当前代码就是：

```ts
const activePollingStatuses = [
  VehicleStatus.DELIVERYING,
  VehicleStatus.PICKING,
  VehicleStatus.LOADING,
  VehicleStatus.RETURN,
  VehicleStatus.MOVING,
  VehicleStatus.CORRECT,
  VehicleStatus.VACANT,
];
```

不在详情页轮询白名单里的 5 个状态：

```ts
const inactivePollingStatuses = [
  VehicleStatus.CHARGING,
  VehicleStatus.DISABLED,
  VehicleStatus.SHUTDOWN,
  VehicleStatus.IN_STARTUP,
  VehicleStatus.IN_SHUTDOWN,
];
```

这就是“状态感知”的核心证据。

