## 8. 当前主实现：DetailMap 状态感知轮询

文件：`src/pages/UnmannedVehicleNew/Vehicle/DetailMap/index.tsx`

模块级定时器：

```ts
let intervalId: NodeJS.Timeout;
```

页面内部状态：

```ts
const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(true);
```

主轮询 effect：

```ts
useEffect(() => {
  if (!businessAreaId || !isVisible) return;

  if (intervalId) {
    clearInterval(intervalId);
  }

  if (
    vehicleDetailInfo?.vehicleAppStatus === VehicleStatus.DELIVERYING ||
    vehicleDetailInfo?.vehicleAppStatus === VehicleStatus.PICKING ||
    vehicleDetailInfo?.vehicleAppStatus === VehicleStatus.LOADING ||
    vehicleDetailInfo?.vehicleAppStatus === VehicleStatus.RETURN ||
    vehicleDetailInfo?.vehicleAppStatus === VehicleStatus.MOVING ||
    vehicleDetailInfo?.vehicleAppStatus === VehicleStatus.CORRECT ||
    vehicleDetailInfo?.vehicleAppStatus === VehicleStatus.VACANT
  ) {
    intervalId = setInterval(() => {
      retrieveRecordDetail();
    }, 5 * 1000);
  }

  return () => {
    if (intervalId) {
      clearInterval(intervalId);
    }
  };
}, [
  transportId,
  vehicleDetailInfo?.vehicleAppStatus,
  retrieveRecordDetail,
  businessAreaId,
  isVisible,
]);
```

这段代码做了几件事：

1. `businessAreaId` 不存在，不轮询。
2. `isVisible=false`，不轮询。
3. 每次 effect 重新执行时先清理旧定时器，避免重复轮询。
4. 只有 7 个业务状态启动 5 秒轮询。
5. 组件卸载或依赖变化时 `clearInterval`。

可以把它抽象成：

```ts
const canPolling =
  Boolean(businessAreaId) &&
  isVisible &&
  [
    DELIVERYING,
    PICKING,
    LOADING,
    RETURN,
    MOVING,
    CORRECT,
    VACANT,
  ].includes(vehicleAppStatus);
```

