## 9. 轮询请求链路：不是只刷一个字段

轮询触发的是 `retrieveRecordDetail()`。

文件：`src/pages/UnmannedVehicleNew/Vehicle/DetailMap/index.tsx`

```ts
const retrieveRecordDetail = useCallback(async () => {
  if (!businessAreaId) return;

  return queryVehicleList({
    businessAreaId,
    udid,
    needExceptionInfo: true,
    needTransportInfo: true,
  }).then((res) => {
    const vehicleInfo = res.data.vehicleList[0];
    // ...
    setVehicleDetailInfo(vehicleInfo);
    setRecordId(currentRecordId);
    setcurrentVehicleRecordId(currentVehicleRecordId);
    // ...
  });
}, [moveInfo, businessAreaId, udid]);
```

接口封装：

```ts
export const queryVehicleList = (data: {
  udid?: string;
  needTransportInfo?: boolean;
  needExceptionInfo?: boolean;
  businessAreaId: string | number;
}) => {
  return httpRequest<VehicleList>(
    '/vehicle/query',
    'POST',
    data
  );
};
```

`/vehicle/query` 返回后会更新：

- `vehicleDetailInfo`：车辆状态、电量、设备状态、异常标签、车辆信息。
- `recordId` / `currentVehicleRecordId`：当前任务记录。
- `stationId`：站点信息。
- `actionList` 依赖的车辆状态。
- 如果是运输相关状态，还会继续查运输详情。

