## 11. 任务节点状态如何随轮询更新

运输详情里 `transportAutoports` 会被转换成 `fulfillmentTaskNodes`：

```ts
const fulfillmentTaskNodes = [
  {
    deliveryImageNumber: 0,
    stopoverPointDetailInfoDTO: {
      eta: dispatchTime ? `${dispatchTime} 已出发` : '',
      staId: businessAreaId,
      staName: businessAreaTitle || '起点',
      title: businessAreaTitle,
      type: 'START_POINT',
    },
  },
  ...(transportAutoports.map((item, index) => {
    const time = getTimeField(item.status);
    const etaTime = formatLocalClock(item[time]);
    const actualArriveTime = formatLocalClock(item?.actualArriveTime);

    return {
      deliveryImageNumber: 0,
      stopoverPointDetailInfoDTO: {
        contractMobile: item.contractMobile,
        eta: actualArriveTime
          ? `${actualArriveTime} 已到达`
          : etaTime ? `${etaTime} ${TransportStatusType[item.status]} ` : '',
        staId: item?.utpAutoportId,
        staName: item?.utpAutoportTitle,
        title: item?.utpAutoportTitle,
        recordStatus: RecordStatusType[item.status],
        type: index === res?.data?.transportAutoports?.length - 1
          ? 'END_POINT'
          : 'POST_POINT',
      },
    };
  })),
];

setFulfillmentTaskNodeDTOS(fulfillmentTaskNodes);
```

状态映射：

```ts
export enum RecordStatusType {
  '初始化' = RecordStatus.CREATING,
  '待执行' = RecordStatus.CREATING,
  '已规划' = RecordStatus.CREATING,
  '行驶中' = RecordStatus.InProgress,
  '停靠中' = RecordStatus.DONE,
  '完成' = RecordStatus.DONE,
  '取消' = RecordStatus.CANCEL,
}
```

面试可以这样讲：

> 轮询拿到运输详情后，我会把后端的 `transportAutoports` 转成前端任务节点模型，节点里带 ETA、站点名称、联系人、节点状态和起终点类型。这样车辆状态变化会同时反映在地图气泡、路线卡片和任务节点上。

