## 12. 地图轨迹如何随轮询更新

`getTransportDetail` 里还会把 `planPath` 和 `historyPath` 转成地图组件需要的路线：

```ts
const routes = [];

transportAutoports.forEach(item => {
  item?.planPath && routes.push({
    path: `LINESTRING(${item?.planPath?.map(
      subItem => `${subItem?.lng} ${subItem?.lat}`
    ).join(',')})`,
    status: 0,
  });

  item?.historyPath && routes.push({
    path: `LINESTRING(${item?.historyPath?.map(
      subItem => `${subItem?.lng} ${subItem?.lat}`
    ).join(',')})`,
    status: 1,
  });
});
```

然后生成 `trackInfo`：

```ts
const newInfo = [{
  staPoints: transportAutoports?.map(item => ({
    staId: item?.utpAutoportId,
    eta: estimateArriveTime ? `${estimateArriveTime}预计到达` : '',
    wkt: `POINT(${item?.utpAutoportLoc?.lng} ${item?.utpAutoportLoc?.lat})`,
    status: 0,
    type: 'POST_POINT',
  })),
  endPoint: {
    wkt: `POINT(${transportAutoports[lastIndex]?.utpAutoportLoc?.lng} ${transportAutoports[lastIndex]?.utpAutoportLoc?.lat})`,
  },
  routes,
}];

setTrackInfo(prev => isEqual(prev, newInfo) ? prev : newInfo);
```

这里也有一个性能细节：

```ts
setTrackInfo(prev => isEqual(prev, newInfo) ? prev : newInfo);
```

如果轮询拿到的数据和上一次一样，就复用旧引用，避免不必要的 React 更新和地图重绘。

